Depends on whether you OpenVMS distribution is the hobbyist disk or
not. If it is then you will have the BASIC distribution on the disk
which must be installed using the VMSINSTAL script. If you've
installed from a standard OpenVMS 7.3 Operating System disk then you
will have to install the BASIC package from a Software Product Library
disk.

