For an un-mounted device there is no label to show :

$ sh dev dga1411

Device                  Device           Error    Volume
  Name                   Status           Count     Label
$1$DGA1411:     (node)  Online               1

$ mount/ove=ide $1$DGA1411
%MOUNT-I-MOUNTED, DISK9 mounted on _$1$DGA1411: (node)

$ sh dev dga1411

Device                  Device           Error    Volume
  Name                   Status           Count     Label
$1$DGA1411:     (node)  Mounted alloc        1    DISK9


And, of course, to be able to mount it has to be initialized
(if not mounted /foreign).


