If this is the square mouse, it provides quadrature outputs.  I have used
them with a variety of devices that required quadrature mice, including
the AT&T 5620 terminal and one of the LMI Lisp Machines.  If you open it up,
the PC board says that it was manufactured by the "Mouse House."

I _think_ that the VCB01 will accept a conection either from the square or
the round mice and function with either one.

I have some spare connecting cables fior the VCB01->VR270 by the way if
anyone needs one.
