> active components on it, just a few tracks.

no, I'm sure it isn't: it is just a black piece of plastic, which
mechanically fits in the qbus slot and supports the card in the upper
part of the bus. quoting from http://hampage.hu/dr/ba123.html :

"As the qbus boards sit vertically in the cardcage, the dual boards in
the upper Q22 slot must have small supporting cards, when there's
nothing in the slot below (or next, depends how you look at it), to
keep them form falling down."



