memory with which I have been able to boot my MicroVAX II is 6MB (8MB 
fitted, 2MB faulty, onboard not apparently working either), you may be able 
to boot with less, but I have not tried. The important thing is also that 
the good memory seems to need to be contiguous. What I meant in a previous 
